      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Order as written:** ibuprofen 1600 mg PO four times daily is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Maximum single dose:** the usual maximum is 800 mg.\n- **Maximum daily dose:** the usual maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day under physician supervision. This order is double that.\n- **Risks at this dose:** GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg PO four times daily:** 3,200 mg/day, the maximum anti-inflammatory dose.\n- **400\u2013600 mg PO every 6 hours:** the usual analgesic dosing.\n- **1600 mg total per day,** divided into smaller doses.\n\nIf you really want 1600 mg four times daily, tell me and add a note with the clinical rationale. I'd suggest confirming that with pharmacy or the attending first. Otherwise, tell me the corrected dose and I'll enter it right away."
      }
